# Frontend environment. Copy to `.env.local` if you need to override a value.
#
# There is no Mock API switch. The dashboard always calls the real Express API,
# and an unreachable backend surfaces as a connection error. The in-memory
# fixture in `src/services/mock/` is imported by tests only.
#
# Absolute Express API origin. Leave it unset to fall back to the same-origin
# `/api/v1` path. When building the Docker image this value is inlined at build
# time, so pass it as a build argument (NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL).
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001/api/v1
